      "description": "Faculty Jobs My settings Life at UA Campus Life Tuscaloosa Benefits Work Life Search Jobs Job Alerts Veterans Faculty Jobs Staff Jobs Student Jobs UA System Jobs My Application Kiosk mode You Belong at the Forefront of Education and Research At The University of Alabama, our work yields legendary results. Embark on a journey of discovery and impact at Alabama's largest university. Dive into groundbreaking research, mentor the next generation, and spark transformative change across local, national and global landscapes. Immerse yourself in a collaborative campus environment, brimming with opportunities to innovate in research, teaching and service. Be part of a community dedicated to shaping a brighter future through excellence and innovation. # WhereLegendsAreMade Barefield   College of Arts & Sciences College of Communication & Information Sciences Styslinger College of Engineering Culverhouse College of Business College of Community Health Sciences College of Education College of Human  Environmental Sciences Capstone College of Nursing School of Law School of Social Work Honors College Graduate School Office for Academic Affairs Office for Research and Economic Development University Libraries School of Leadership and Policy All Faculty Positions FOLLOW US Accessibility | Equal Opportunity | About This Site | Webmaster Copyright © 2021 The University of Alabama | Disclaimer | Privacy | Accessibility Candidate Details × This website uses cookies to collect information to improve your browsing experience. Please review our Privacy Statement for more information. I do not accept I accept"
