    "https://uastudentjobs.ua.edu/": {
      "title": "Student Employment",
      "description": "UA Student Jobs Skip to content myBama UA Student Jobs Expand title bar menu Close title bar menu Search This Site Submit Student Resources Hiring Manager Resources Student Employee of the Year On-Campus Student Job Fair Student Employment On our website students can find tools to help find a student job, while parents, supervisors and employers have access to general information for both on-campus and off-campus jobs. Job Site Student Employment WELCOME Student employment is an integral part of the educational and professional development of UA students. Working while in college not only helps students finance their education, it also assists in developing essential job and life-long learning skills, and provides opportunities to network and connect with faculty, staff, and fellow students who can help with the transition to life at UA. The experience gained is instrumental in preparing students for the job market after graduation and beyond. Post a Job Apply Now SEOTY Award Upcoming: 2026 On-Campus Student Job Fair Human Resources and the SGA will partner together in hosting the 2026 On-Campus Student Job Fair. In 2025, we had over 400 students in attendance, participation from 20 departments, and 3 student raffle prize winners. If you are an on-campus department interested in participating this fair, get added to our contact list by emailing uastudentjobs@ua.edu . Contact us HERE ARE SOME USEFUL LINKS The Department of Human Resources advertises undergraduate and graduate student assistant positions, both on-campus and off-campus. These student positions are compensated on an hourly basis, with payments made via direct deposit for the student’s personal use. For opportunities related to educational expenses, we recommend contacting the Financial Aid office to explore Work Study options or contacting the Graduate School for Graduate Assistantships. For further details, please refer to the links below. graduation cap Graduate Assistantships school Work Study Positions briefcase Faculty/Staff Positions uastudentjobe@ua.edu https://www.instagram.com/uastudentemployment/ https://www.facebook.com/UAStudentJobs/ https://twitter.com/UAStudentJobs Copyright © 2026 The University of Alabama (205) 348-6010 Contact UA Accessibility SACSCOC Taskstream Equal Opportunity Data Access Request Disclaimer Privacy This website uses cookies to collect information to improve your browsing experience. Please review our Privacy Statement for more information. I understand"
